{
  "project": "Ferret Shop",
  "pipeline": "NB2 on solid magenta #FF00FF -> magick -fuzz 20% -transparent magenta -trim +repage -resize 2N -resize N",
  "style": "2D top-down game sprite, seen from directly above, flat cartoon style, clean edges, no shadow, isolated on solid magenta #FF00FF background",
  "model": "google/nano-banana-2/text-to-image (via wisdom-image-gen --model nb2)",
  "generated": "05Sep26s (animals, items, furniture) / 08Mar26u (ferret, granny)",
  "notes": [
    "Magenta keys better than white: white edges bleed into the transparency.",
    "NB2 picks its own aspect from the prompt. A square-worded sprite prompt returns 1024x1024; ask for a wide object and it returns 1408x768.",
    "WaveSpeed's safety filter rejects 'ferret', 'parrot' and 'medieval key'. Use 'weasel', 'budgie' and 'cartoon key'.",
    "`faces` is which way the artwork points, and it decides the rotation offset in game.js: up -> +PI/2, down -> -PI/2. NB2 chose these, they were not requested, so each one is recorded rather than assumed.",
    "Sprite files are deliberately larger than their on-screen size so they stay crisp; game.js scales them with setDisplaySize()."
  ],
  "sprites": [
    {
      "id": "ferret",
      "filename": "ferret.png",
      "file_size_px": "32x90",
